        "created_at": "2012-09-20T05:11:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have several questions about the environment cards which have some condition to destroy that card.</p><p>1) If a player is incapacitated, are they unable to discard cards from their deck or hand, making it impossible to do an action that requires each player to do these things?</p><p>2) Can an incapacitated hero skip the rest of their turn to destroy a card?</p><p>3) On police backup it says \"Whenever a villain card would make a player discard a card, destroy this card.\"&nbsp; Does the use of the word 'would' mean that you don't have to discard the card?&nbsp; (meaning police backup is destroyed instead of discarding the card).</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:36:12.598Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
