        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-09-20T08:51:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My take.</p><p>1) Incapacitated heroes have no hand or deck, so they can't help in this case.</p><p>2) Yes, if Infected heroes can remain infected and deal damage, so can they skip their turns.</p><p>3) For the lack of the word \"instead\", I would say, every player still discards their cards, and, police backup gets destroyed.</p>",
